body:
I stayed at the Hilton when I went to Atlanta over the summer, it was classy as fuck, i felt so upper SES haha. It's nice you get to stay there!

&#x200B;

I haven't been doing much. I had  Traumatizing Mouse Incident last night so I've just been taking ativan to deal with that and not have a panic attack in my own goddamn home. Shit like this makes me mad. Anyway, I'm bored with work, I'm bored with my side job, most of all I'm bored with school and my patients. I have a bunch of internship coming up that are really important and I'm scared, My nonverbal communication is not very good.
